=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Leepe-Hoppe} on top of the {p:Rhinostery} to start the quest.
* {n:Leepe-Hoppe} requires 3 items, all of which must be farmed from {p:Chains of Promathia} areas.
** An {i:Extra-Fine File|Extra-Fine File|1698} can be found by defeating {p:Fomor|Category:Fomor} in {z:Lufaise Meadows}. Specifically, {m:Fomor Warrior}, {m:Fomor Monk}, {m:Fomor Dark Knight}, {m:Fomor Paladin}, and {m:Fomor Samurai}.
** A piece of {i:Spruce Lumber|Spruce Lumber|1697} can be found by defeating {p:Taurus} in {z:Phomiuna Aqueducts}. 3 {p:Taurus} can be found at (G-6) of Map 1. Enter {z:Phomiuna Aqueducts} from {z:Tavnazian Safehold}, or use the {p:Survival Guide} and head northwest.
** An ingot of {i:Magicked Steel|Magicked Steel|1696} is found on various Goblins in {z:Oldton Movalpolos}. It is advised to farm {m:Goblin Oilman}, as anecdotal reports show these mobs have a higher drop rate. Use the {p:Proto-Waypoint}, drop down the ledge, and head West.
* You need to trade all 3 of these items to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} at once to complete the quest. Speak to {n:Leepe-Hoppe} again to start the {q:Tuning Out|Tuning Out|Tuning Out} quest.

